    !/**
    !  @Version 1.0
    !  @Group Frequencyconverters
    !  @Summary Drive Sinamics G120 with Free telegram 999 PZD12/PZD12
    !  Drive Sinamics G120 with Free telegram 999 PZD12/PZD12
    ! 
    !  IOConnect this object with the IO-object in a Sinamics_Tgm999_PnModule
    !  For detailed info on how to setup the drive and how to scale the
    !  analog signals see help for Sinamics_Tgm999_IoModule
    !  @b Simple example
    !  @image orm_sinamics_g120_tgm999.png
    ! 
